dialect protocol
protocol stdio.md.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.md
start record

# P2-FG1: REAL binary op frame, replacing F6's `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut
# (`../../🦀️.rs`'s old `OpBinary::encode_op`) -- per the P2-W0 census this was still on
# that shortcut. `MdMutation` is a genuine data-carrying enum whose variants embed a recursive
# `MdBlock`/`Vec<MdInline>`/`Vec<MdPathStep>` (each itself a data-carrying enum/collection) -- no
# `DslField` impl exists or can exist for any of them (blanket impls cover only
# ints/bool/String/Vec<T where T: DslField>/BTreeMap/[T;N]/DslValue/Wire, never a data-carrying
# enum), so the generic `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout
# (`pack_rt::encode_record_body`/`dsl::variants_binary::encode_op`, both requiring a `RecordSpec`
# derived FROM a `DslField` impl) genuinely does not fit -- confirmed by re-reading the type, not
# assumed (same structural blocker `MdMutation`'s own doc comment cites, mirrored from
# `SvgMutation`/`JsonMutation`'s). Handcrafted instead: `format u8` (`store::OP_BINARY_FORMAT`
# convention) + `tag u8` (the `MdMutation` variant ordinal, same 0-5 order
# `parse_md_mutation`'s own keyword match uses) as two REAL fixed fields, then the variant's own
# recursive path/index/block/inlines payload as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain.
#
# The recursive payload itself is real LEB128-varint-framed binary
# (`enc_block_bin`/`enc_inline_list_bin`/`enc_path_bin`/`enc_snapshot_bin` in
# `../../🦀️.rs`, reusing `store::pack_rt::write_varint_u64`/`store::ByteReader`) -- NOT
# re-modeled field-by-field here because `Prim::Ref` (the only construct that could describe
# `MdBlock`'s self-recursion at the protocol-dialect level) unconditionally errors during
# `walk_protocol` (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`, recipe §5 -- confirmed unchanged through every
# FG-wave pilot, not fixed by this wave either). Same honest-boundary treatment the plan itself
# prescribes for a compressed payload segment -- opaque at the protocol layer, genuinely structured
# (and round-trip-tested) at the Rust layer. Filed as `mechanism_gaps` in this wave's report
# (non-blocking; worked around locally exactly as described here, same as json/csv/zip/png/binary).
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
